Step 6: Develop the Root Component

So now we have the interfaces and components basic set up. Now, let’s focus on

implementing the portal home page, which involves setting up the root component. The

root component will consist of three tabs as per the design requirements.

• The first tab is a form that allows users to submit a new request.

• The second tab is a table that displays all the submitted requests of

the logged-in user.

• The third tab is a table that displays all pending requests from all

users. However, this tab will be visible only if the logged-in user is a

member of the Service Executives group.

